  "commit_message": "Link to a single option instead of the whole checker section (#11261)\n\nThe options page only had one anchor per checker, so a message page that\nwanted to point at a single option sent the reader to the top of a\nsection holding a dozen of them.\n\nEmit an '<option-name>-option' label before each option title, and use it\nin the three places that were linking to a checker section.",
